    "linkedin:73d40f8a7d302e950256c058": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Frontend Developer",
        "company": "Fomi",
        "location": "",
        "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4481058017",
        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "**Product\\-Minded Frontend Engineer** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**FOMI \\| Islamabad, Pakistan \\| Full\\-Time \\| On\\-Site \\& Remote** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Before you apply — please read this carefully.** \n\n\n\n\n We believe attention to detail matters. And this is your first opportunity to demonstrate it.\n **For priority consideration, apply directly through:** \n\n\n\n\n 👉\n **www.tinyurl.com/fomicareers** \n\n\n\n\n Applications submitted through this link will be prioritized over LinkedIn Easy Apply submissions.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**You don't just build what people imagine. You make it real.** \n\n\n\n\n Imagine building a creative studio where someone describes an idea and watches it become an image, a video, or something they never thought possible.\n \n\n\n\n Now imagine being one of the people who made that experience possible—not just writing the code, but deciding how it should work, feel, and come to life.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**That's the kind of engineer we're looking for at FOMI.** \n\n\n\n\n We're building an AI\\-powered creative platform for a global audience. Our ambition isn't simply to build another AI tool. It's to create an experience so intuitive, beautiful, and enjoyable that people can't imagine going back to the way they created before.\n \n\n\n\n And frontend engineering is at the heart of making that happen.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**We want more than someone who can code.** \n\n\n\n\n We want someone who sees a clunky interaction and immediately imagines something better. Someone who notices the tiny details that make a product feel premium. Someone who uses AI tools like Claude to build faster, experiment boldly, and turn ambitious ideas into working experiences.\n \n\n\n\n You care about the\n *why* \n , not just the\n *how* \n . You have an eye for design, think about the user, and take pride in building things that work beautifully—not merely things that work.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What you'll do** \n\n\n\n* Build polished, responsive experiences across FOMI's AI creative studio.\n* Turn complex AI capabilities into interactions that feel simple, fluid, and almost magical.\n* Use AI coding tools to prototype, build, debug, and iterate at speed.\n* Sweat the details: animations, transitions, loading states, performance, and usability.\n* Challenge assumptions, suggest better solutions, and help shape the product itself.\n* Work directly with the founding team, designers, and AI engineers to bring ideas to life.\n\n\n\n**What matters to us** \n\n\n\n\n Strong frontend fundamentals. A great eye for design. Product instinct. Curiosity. Initiative.\n \n\n\n\n We care about what you've built, how you think, and the quality of your decisions—not just your years of experience or the number of technologies on your CV.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Why FOMI?** \n\n\n\n\n**Your ideas can shape the product.** \n Join while its defining experiences are still being created.\n \n\n\n\n**Build at the edge of what's possible.** \n Work where AI, engineering, design, and creativity meet.\n \n\n\n\n**Make something worth remembering.** \n Help create experiences that people around the world will use to bring their imagination to life.\n \n\n\n\n A few years from now, you could be looking at a product used by creators worldwide and know that you helped make it exceptional.\n \n\n\n\n**If you see a product and immediately think of ten ways to make it better, we want to meet you.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**FOMI — Figment of my imagination.** \n\n\n\n\n*Come help us turn imagination into experience.*",
